  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>minutes</mi></math>, a body cools from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>75</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>65</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> at room temperature of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The temperature of body at the end of next <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>minutes</mi></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><menclose notation=\"bottom\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></menclose></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts/><none/><mo>&#8728;</mo></mmultiscripts><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "57",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>By newton&#39;s law of cooling (with approximation),&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>ag</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>st</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>45</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>nd</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>65</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>65</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>45</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>570</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p>",
